         <p class=\"glue-header__logo--product\">Trust Services</p>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#page-content\" class=\"glue-header__skip-content\" aria-label=\"Skip to page content\">\n              <p class=\"glue-header__skip-content-text\">\n                Jump to Content\n              </p>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"glue-header__container glue-header__container--flex-auto\">\n          <nav class=\"glue-header__link-bar\">\n            <ul id=\"list-1\" class=\"glue-header__list\">\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item glue-header--is-active\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"/\">Overview</a>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"https://developers.google.com/public-key-infrastructure/services\">Services</a>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"/repository/\">Repository</a>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"/faq/\">FAQ and contact</a>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"https://developers.google.com/public-key-infrastructure/testing\">Testing</a>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"glue-header__item\">\n                <a class=\"glue-header__link\" href=\"https://developers.google.com/public-key-infrastructure/updates/\">Updates</a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </nav>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"glue-header__bar glue-header__bar--mobile\" id=\"drawer\">\n      <div class=\"glue-header__tier\">\n        <div class=\"glue-header__container\">\n          <div class=\"glue-header__lock-up\">\n            <div class=\"glue-header__hamburger glue-header__hamburger--first-tier\">\n              <div class=\"glue-header__hamburger-wrapper\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"glue-header__drawer-toggle-btn\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"\n                  aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open the navigation drawer\">\n                  <svg role=\"img\" class=\"glue-icon glue-icon--24px\">\n                    <title>Menu</title>\n                    <use xlink:href=\"/static/assets/img/glue-icons.svg#menu\">\n                    </use>\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"glue-header__logo\">\n              <a class=\"glue-header__logo-link\" href=\"/\" title=\"Google\">\n                <div class=\"glue-header__logo-container\">\n                  <svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"glue-header__logo-svg\">\n                    <use xlink:href=\"/static/assets/img/glue-icons.svg#google-color-logo\">\n                    </use>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"glue-header__logo--product\">Trust Services</p>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glue-header__drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n  </header>\n  <main class=\"glue-page\" id=\"page-content\">\n    <div class=\"headline-container glue-mod-spacer-6-bottom\">\n      <h1 class=\"main-heading\">\n        Google Trust Services\n      </h1>\n      <h2 class=\"sub-heading\">\n        Helping build a safer internet by providing a transparent, trusted, and reliable Certificate Authority.\n      </h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"glue-banner glue-banner--medium-emphasis glue-banner--banner-box\">\n      <div class=\"glue-banner__content\">\n        <p class=\"glue-mod-text-center\"><span>We are excited to announce that we now offer publicly-trusted TLS\n            certificates for free via the GTS ACME API. Learn&nbsp;</span><a\n            href=\"https://cloud.google.com/certificate-manager/docs/public-ca-tutorial\" rel=\"noopener\"\n            target=\"_blank\">how you can use the API using your GCP account</a><span>&nbsp;and read more about it on the\n            <a href=\"https://security.googleblog.com/2023/05/google-trust-services-acme-api_0503894189.html\"\n              rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Security Blog</a>.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h2 class=\"paragraph-title glue-headline glue-headline--headline-5\">\n        Overview &amp; benefits\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content glue-mod-spacer-3-bottom\">\n        <p>Encryption is an important building block for a safer internet. Google Trust Services provides Transport\n          Layer Security (TLS) certificates for Google services and users helping to authenticate and encrypt internet\n          traffic. The service is built on Google&rsquo;s geographically distributed infrastructure and backed by\n          security and compliance audits helping to provide a transparent, trusted, and reliable Certificate Authority.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table glue-grid\">\n      <div class=\"table-cell glue-grid__col glue-grid__col--span-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"table-cell-heading\">\n          Transparency\n        </h3>\n        <p>Our Certificate Policy and Certification Practice Statement detail our issuance practices, as does this\n          website. Our goal is to earn your trust and to lead in both transparency and security.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-cell glue-grid__col glue-grid__col--span-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"table-cell-heading\">\n          Compliance\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"compliance-body\">\n          <div class=\"compliance-text-container\">\n            <p>Google Trust Services regularly undergoes independent audits of security, privacy, and compliance\n              controls, achieving certifications against global industry standards.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"certificate-images\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.cpacanada.ca/webtrustseal?sealid=11852\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              class=\"seal-container\">\n              <img src=\"images/webtrust_certificationauthorities-min.png\" alt=\"WebTrust for Certification Authorities Seal\" class=\"seal-image\">\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.cpacanada.ca/webtrustseal?sealid=11853\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              class=\"seal-container\">\n              <img src=\"images/webtrust_br-ssl-min.png\" alt=\"WebTrust Baseline Requirements for SSL/TLS Seal\" class=\"seal-image\">\n            </a>\n            <p></p>\n            <a href=\"https://www.cpacanada.ca/webtrustseal?sealid=11854\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              class=\"seal-container\">\n              <img src=\"images/webtrust_network-security-min.png\" alt=\"WebTrust Network Security Requirements Seal\" class=\"seal-image\">\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.cpacanada.ca/webtrustseal?sealid=11855\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              class=\"seal-container\">\n              <img src=\"images/webtrust_s-mime-min.png\" alt=\"WebTrust S/MIME Requirements Seal\" class=\"seal-image\">\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-cell glue-grid__col glue-grid__col--span-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"table-cell-heading\">\n          Security\n        </h3>\n        <p>The technical design of the service is underpinned by leading security expertise. In addition to the\n          compliance audits, the service regularly undergoes independent assessments to confirm the security of the\n          underlying infrastructure.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-cell glue-grid__col glue-grid__col--span-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"table-cell-heading\">\n          Availability\n        </h3>\n        <p>Google Trust Services operates from geographically distributed facilities and uses Google's proven technical\n          infrastructure to provide a high level of availability globally.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glue-mod-spacer-7-top\">\n      <div class=\"overview-page-link\">\n        <h2 class=\"glue-headline\">\n          Detailed information\n        </h2>\n        <p>Certificate details, log information, and other technical information.</p>\n        <a href=\"/repository/\">\n          Repository\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overview-page-link\">\n        <h2 class=\"glue-headline\">\n          Are you experiencing an issue? Do you have any questions?\n        </h2>\n        <p>Head to our FAQ page to find helpful information.</p>\n        <a href=\"/faq/\">\n          FAQ and contact\n        </a>\n        <p>Visit our status page for information on outages and upcoming maintenance.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://status.pki.goog/\" target=\"_blank\">\n          status.pki.goog\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"glue-footer\">\n    <section class=\"glue-footer__global\">\n      <div class=\"glue-footer__logo\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.google.com\" title=\"Google\" aria-label=\"Google homepage\">\n          <svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"glue-footer__logo-img\">\n            <use xlink:href=\"/static/assets/img/glue-icons.svg#google-solid-logo\">\n            </use>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <ul class=\"glue-footer__global-links glue-no-bullet\">\n        <li class=\"glue-footer__global-links-list-item\">\n          <a class=\"glue-footer__link\" href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">\n            Privacy\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"glue-footer__global-links-list-item\">\n          <a class=\"glue-footer__link\" href=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\">\n            Terms\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"glue-footer__global-links-list-item\">\n          <a class=\"glue-footer__link\" href=\"https://about.google\">\n            About Google\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"glue-footer__global-links-list-item\">\n          <a class=\"glue-footer__link\" href=\"https://about.google/products/\">\n            Google Products\n          </a>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"glue-footer__global-links glue-footer__global-links--extra glue-no-bullet\">\n        <li class=\"glue-footer__global-links-list-item glue-footer__global-links-list-item--extra\">\n          <a class=\"glue-footer__link help\" href=\"https://support.google.com/?hl=en\" aria-label=\"Google support page\">\n            <svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"glue-icon glue-icon--24px glue-icon--footer\">\n              <use xlink:href=\"/static/assets/img/glue-icons.svg#help\"></use>\n            </svg>\n            <p>Help</p>\n          </a>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </footer>\n  <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-JCEW5SPNPE\" nonce=\"oVQl4xMX8D156TMFUpSObg\"></script>\n  <script nonce=\"oVQl4xMX8D156TMFUpSObg\">\n    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n    function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\n    gtag('js', new Date());\n\n    gtag('config', 'G-JCEW5SPNPE');\n  </script>\n  <script data-autoload-cookie-consent-bar=\"true\" data-autoload-cookie-consent-bar-intl-code=\"\"\n    src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/brandstudio/kato/cookie_choice_component/cookie_consent_bar.v3.js\" nonce=\"oVQl4xMX8D156TMFUpSObg\">\n    </script>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/external_hosted/hammerjs/v2_0_2/hammer.min.js\" nonce=\"oVQl4xMX8D156TMFUpSObg\"></script>\n  <script src=\"/static/index.min.js?cache=1d74383\" nonce=\"oVQl4xMX8D156TMFUpSObg\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
